  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XLhWGhC.png\" alt=\"Title\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmars_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Support me on ko-fi\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanted-books-from-mars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1268200?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=Curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchanted-books-from-mars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/enchanted-books-from-mars?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>這個模組為每本附魔書提供獨有的紋理，使其更容易一眼就找到所需的書。這基於我之前製作的一個<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/different-textures-for-enchanted-books\" rel=\"nofollow\">資源包</a>，該資源包需要一個額外實現CITs的模組才能工作。使用此模組，您不需要下載資源包並依賴於可能在不同版本的Minecraft和加載器之間變化的單獨CIT模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">新紋理的示例</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">資源包 <strong>ON</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ClzoG9Q.png\" width=\"460\" height=\"563\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gF6wPij.png\" width=\"460\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">資源包 <strong>OFF</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/buQW2Sc.png\" width=\"460\" height=\"572\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qg9kIju.png\" width=\"460\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><strong>配置</strong></h6>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以直接在遊戲中配置此模組，或者通過編輯配置文件<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>config/ebooks.json</code></a>來調整設置。如果您使用的是Fabric並希望在遊戲中調整配置值，則需要安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>模組。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>turned_on</strong> - 打開或關閉來自此模組的附魔書紋理</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/zjuxc\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y3LiTfU.png\"></a></p>",
